# GitHub Packages registry for the @Adithya-Meda scoped package.
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN must be set in the environment before running npm ci.
# In CI: passed as a BuildKit secret (never baked into the image).
# In local dev: export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) or create a PAT.
# Note: replace @Adithya-Meda with your actual GitHub org/username when forking.
@Adithya-Meda:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
